WEBVTT

00:00.020 --> 00:03.440
<b>The Sad Dog 
Warrior IV</b>

00:02.320 --> 00:06.580
<i>I don't know who I am anymore.</i>

00:08.000 --> 00:11.180
<i>The monstrous power welling up within me...</i>

00:11.180 --> 00:13.480
<i>is driving me mad.</i>

00:17.280 --> 00:18.500
<i>Him...</i>

00:18.760 --> 00:21.460
<i>I knew it. He wasn't dead after all.</i>

00:21.720 --> 00:24.750
<i>Has he come to take his magical energy back?</i>

00:25.580 --> 00:27.010
<i>I'll hunt him down!</i>

00:27.290 --> 00:32.420
<i>That world I had always envisioned</i>

00:32.420 --> 00:36.050
<i>Could I have found it?</i>

00:44.940 --> 00:49.570
<i>I lived my days at someone 
else's convenience</i>

00:49.980 --> 00:54.200
<i>Gaining nothing but compromises and regrets</i>

00:54.200 --> 00:56.320
<i>Because I always felt that</i>

00:56.320 --> 01:00.200
<i>Even if it wasn't me standing here</i>

01:00.200 --> 01:04.250
<i>The world would still keep moving forward</i>

01:04.250 --> 01:08.040
<i>Even after I lost it</i>

01:08.040 --> 01:10.340
<i>And its colors faded</i>

01:10.340 --> 01:14.420
<i>The dream from that hazily remembered day</i>

01:14.420 --> 01:16.380
<i>Still remained</i>

01:16.380 --> 01:18.800
<i>The thing that only I can do</i>

01:18.800 --> 01:21.510
<i>And the scenery that I left behind</i>

01:21.510 --> 01:29.020
<i>I was just looking for an answer 
from some other time</i>

01:30.360 --> 01:35.240
<i>Those things that don't change</i>

01:35.240 --> 01:40.830
<i>And those words I protected so carefully</i>

01:40.830 --> 01:45.450
<i>Even if they're all just 
unattractive junk to others</i>

01:45.450 --> 01:53.840
<i>They're all treasures 
that I will never give up</i>

02:01.440 --> 02:04.520
If you're all right with it...

02:05.220 --> 02:10.100
would you be so good 
as to take my daughter, Raelza?

02:11.600 --> 02:14.250
Morlock-san, that's...

02:14.250 --> 02:16.910
You have to consider Raelza's feelings, too.

02:17.660 --> 02:20.840
She likes you very much.

02:21.400 --> 02:22.960
Can't you tell?

02:22.960 --> 02:26.130
Lafa and I noticed a long time ago.

02:29.160 --> 02:30.150
More than anyone else...

02:30.150 --> 02:33.000
I need you.

02:33.680 --> 02:36.880
I have no memories of my family.

02:37.390 --> 02:40.760
And that's the reason why, 
after losing my memories,

02:41.020 --> 02:45.610
when I found Raelza in the forest, 
I raised her with as much care as I could.

02:47.380 --> 02:52.220
If I were to entrust my daughter 
to someone, you are the only one.

02:52.220 --> 02:57.690
Of course, if you don't wish it, 
I won't force you.

03:05.240 --> 03:06.600
All right.

03:06.600 --> 03:10.450
I don't think a guy like me 
is good enough for Raelza,

03:10.920 --> 03:12.040
but I'll do my best!

03:15.400 --> 03:16.540
So...

03:16.840 --> 03:19.420
At this sort of moment, it's, you know...

03:30.730 --> 03:33.710
Please let me have your daughter!

03:36.210 --> 03:37.600
Oh, oh...

03:37.600 --> 03:40.220
Oh, oh, oh!

03:40.820 --> 03:43.620
Saitou! Well said!

03:43.620 --> 03:45.940
Please say the same to Raelza, too!

03:45.940 --> 03:49.290
I will. But before that, 
let's find that dog!

03:49.640 --> 03:52.360
Please live a long life, Father!

03:53.320 --> 03:56.830
Saitou...

03:57.450 --> 03:58.050
Huh?

04:18.530 --> 04:19.990
Morlock-san!

04:19.990 --> 04:21.470
Morlock-san!

04:24.180 --> 04:26.630
Master and Saitou are taking a long time.

04:26.630 --> 04:30.460
With the geezer's magic, they should 
be fine even if undead show up.

04:30.460 --> 04:33.240
But Grandpa isn't doing so well.

04:35.160 --> 04:36.260
I'll go and see.

04:37.030 --> 04:38.840
You two look for that dog.

04:40.120 --> 04:42.400
Despite what she says, she's worried.

04:42.400 --> 04:43.900
They're not blood relatives,

04:43.900 --> 04:46.440
but that's her father 
and her future husband out there.

04:46.440 --> 04:47.700
Really?

04:47.700 --> 04:48.780
Really.

04:48.780 --> 04:52.440
Leave searching for the dog 
to me. You should go too.

04:52.440 --> 04:55.940
If they can't use magic, 
then the worst could befall them.

04:55.940 --> 04:57.150
All right.

05:03.020 --> 05:06.240
That old geezer, causing all this trouble...

05:06.240 --> 05:09.200
He is getting old. 
Maybe it's time to retire.

05:09.540 --> 05:10.460
No.

05:10.940 --> 05:13.760
<i>If we hurry up and hit it rich 
in the great labyrinth,</i>

05:13.760 --> 05:16.450
<i>then maybe we could live 
a leisurely life together and...</i>

05:16.970 --> 05:19.200
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

05:29.980 --> 05:32.240
Saitou! Grandpa!

05:39.400 --> 05:40.690
Who do I treat first?

05:40.690 --> 05:41.810
Saitou!

05:41.810 --> 05:43.830
Saitou is still breathing! Help him!

05:43.830 --> 05:44.880
But...

05:44.880 --> 05:47.700
Do you have magic that can help 
the geezer the way he is right now?

05:54.530 --> 05:55.430
Go!

05:57.140 --> 05:58.330
All right.

06:02.180 --> 06:04.970
O, threads from the pulse 
of magic, dwarves of life,

06:04.970 --> 06:07.360
I, a master of alchemy from the age of gods,

06:07.930 --> 06:10.800
command you to perform 
a surgery upon the altar of spirit.

06:12.320 --> 06:16.850
You've hurt <i>two</i> people who are important to me!

06:20.460 --> 06:23.740
<i>So you're an ally 
of those two-legs, are you?</i>

06:23.740 --> 06:28.240
I'll cut you into pieces and retrieve 
the geezer's magic from your entrails!

06:30.200 --> 06:31.070
<i>I'll kill it!</i>

06:31.280 --> 06:32.290
<i>I'll hunt them down!</i>

06:35.740 --> 06:39.210
<b>Magical Beast Hunter 
Liliza Speaks</b>

06:36.480 --> 06:38.990
The way to take down a hellhound?

06:39.390 --> 06:41.520
This can be said for all 
magical beasts in general,

06:42.190 --> 06:45.670
but aiming for the insides of the mouth
 with a blade is dangerous.

06:45.950 --> 06:49.060
They have strong jaws, 
so they'll take your weapon.

06:49.300 --> 06:50.300
And then...

06:50.300 --> 06:53.030
they'll aim for your wrists next, so...

06:54.380 --> 06:56.180
In the worst case, you'll end up like this.

06:56.470 --> 07:01.740
Though Raelza and Flanril 
wouldn't mess up that way, I'm sure.

07:02.190 --> 07:03.650
<i>Blast it!</i>

07:06.860 --> 07:09.930
<i>But... this might be my chance 
to hit a vital spot.</i>

07:11.620 --> 07:14.540
The other thing 
to be really careful of is...

07:17.120 --> 07:19.040
Fire Breath?

07:20.920 --> 07:22.840
<i>If you take that at close range...</i>

07:23.050 --> 07:25.040
Raelza!

07:25.040 --> 07:26.880
<i>...your armor will get blown off,</i>

07:30.030 --> 07:30.990
<i>and your flesh will...</i>

07:30.990 --> 07:32.740
<i>Though my body may split apart...</i>

07:35.930 --> 07:37.840
<i>the penalty for hurting...</i>

07:40.840 --> 07:42.680
<i>those I love...</i>

07:47.070 --> 07:48.280
<i>That hit landed!</i>

07:48.280 --> 07:48.900
<i>Now, to finish it!</i>

07:54.860 --> 07:55.840
A packmate?

07:55.840 --> 07:58.280
No... they're parent and child.

08:00.070 --> 08:01.740
<i>This voice...</i>

08:06.150 --> 08:09.360
<i>So it remembered my demonic form.</i>

08:25.430 --> 08:27.210
I've lost.

08:27.560 --> 08:30.980
Kill me... while I'm still in my right mind.

08:32.520 --> 08:34.420
But if I could make one last request...

08:34.820 --> 08:37.520
Spare my son's life.

08:37.520 --> 08:38.160
I beg you.

08:38.160 --> 08:38.950
What?

08:39.500 --> 08:41.050
You...

08:41.050 --> 08:44.050
You hurt those most precious 
to me and you ask that?!

08:44.050 --> 08:46.230
Raelza, your arm!

08:46.230 --> 08:47.540
Raelza...

08:47.540 --> 08:49.700
Morlock-san isn't moving.

08:50.060 --> 08:52.170
And his regeneration isn't starting either.

08:52.660 --> 08:55.400
If Grandpa can't use magic,

08:55.400 --> 08:58.180
then he won't be able to 
absorb magical energy!

09:01.120 --> 09:04.180
Fine. The pup will be spared.

09:05.890 --> 09:07.340
But...

09:07.560 --> 09:11.540
I will cut off all four of your limbs 
and draw out his magical energy.

09:11.960 --> 09:14.740
That is when we'll call this matter settled!

09:23.150 --> 09:24.800
What is that?!

09:24.800 --> 09:27.080
This grotesque appearance... 
This magical energy!

09:27.080 --> 09:29.080
It's a greater demon!

09:34.360 --> 09:35.720
It's disappearing?!

09:43.140 --> 09:44.550
Raelza!

09:44.550 --> 09:46.440
I don't know what that is,

09:46.440 --> 09:48.820
but everything will go wrong 
if it takes the dog!

09:54.500 --> 09:56.240
I'm not giving up!

09:56.240 --> 09:58.120
Not on Morlock-san's resurrection!

09:58.120 --> 09:59.620
Saitou...

10:00.910 --> 10:03.570
We can't let it take that dog!

10:05.220 --> 10:08.000
O, threads from the pulse 
of magic, dwarves of life,

10:08.000 --> 10:10.010
I, a master of alchemy from the age of gods,

10:10.010 --> 10:13.040
command you to perform 
a surgery upon the altar of spirit.

10:17.510 --> 10:18.650
It's good.

10:18.650 --> 10:19.920
Infuse my sword with magic.

10:19.920 --> 10:22.610
O, blade... O momentary dwelling...

10:22.610 --> 10:24.410
Now hold and keep my magic!

10:24.410 --> 10:25.520
It's ready!

10:28.980 --> 10:32.620
Citizen of the demon realm! 
That is our quarry!

10:32.620 --> 10:33.990
Leave it and go!

10:33.990 --> 10:36.700
The hunting dog that killed my younger 
brother was cursed by our master.

10:36.700 --> 10:40.000
It should have shriveled up and died by now.

10:40.230 --> 10:44.990
But he ended up eating a tremendous amount 
of magical energy here, on the surface.

10:45.000 --> 10:49.630
By our master's order, 
I will take this traitor back with me.

10:50.030 --> 10:55.360
I must take my younger brother's 
killer back still breathing.

10:55.360 --> 10:56.760
Can you understand my frustration?!

10:59.920 --> 11:04.020
Vengeance for my younger brother... 
I will have you pay the price!

11:04.020 --> 11:06.720
Seven thunderbolts in formation...

11:06.720 --> 11:08.420
The Seven Thunder Gods?!

11:08.420 --> 11:09.680
This is bad!

11:09.680 --> 11:11.900
We'll defeat him before he 
finishes the incantation!

11:17.650 --> 11:20.440
six blasts, five swords, four spears,

11:20.440 --> 11:23.040
three are my fangs, two are my arms,

11:23.040 --> 11:26.670
these words unleashed by my mind 
shall become blades of lightning!

11:27.000 --> 11:29.080
<i>He speaks the spell so quickly!</i>

11:29.080 --> 11:31.870
Explode, Thunder Gods!

11:32.400 --> 11:35.370
Recompense for life offered 
unto the moonlight...

11:35.640 --> 11:38.640
Protect now, Seven Linked Shields of Gold!

11:43.220 --> 11:45.850
<i>Turning gold coins into magic shields?</i>

11:45.850 --> 11:51.100
<i>But no one with such a tiny body 
could possibly block my power!</i>

11:51.400 --> 11:54.990
Seven gold coins... You owe me, you know?

11:58.360 --> 12:00.170
You little...

12:01.070 --> 12:04.120
I-I will not allow it!

12:08.500 --> 12:12.210
Wh-Why is this... happening to...

12:17.960 --> 12:20.780
Greater demons are unexpectedly weak.

12:20.780 --> 12:23.320
No, you're just completely reckless!

12:25.930 --> 12:27.240
Saitou...

12:28.230 --> 12:30.430
For now, let's take the dog back with us.

12:30.430 --> 12:32.100
Yes, we should do that.

12:34.560 --> 12:37.250
Wh-What is that?

12:37.750 --> 12:40.720
Master...

12:42.310 --> 12:44.300
Scorching heat,

12:46.340 --> 12:50.190
cage ablaze, fill now with spirit and will.

13:05.310 --> 13:06.400
Master!

13:06.400 --> 13:07.630
It can't be...

13:08.430 --> 13:10.650
Oh, get out of the way!

13:10.650 --> 13:13.370
Why are there so many undead here?

13:14.400 --> 13:16.320
Master!

13:16.320 --> 13:18.570
Blast it! Saitou!

13:18.570 --> 13:20.100
Raelza...

13:20.360 --> 13:21.580
Lafa is...

13:21.580 --> 13:22.990
She used magic to block it...

13:22.990 --> 13:24.560
but she isn't moving!

13:24.560 --> 13:25.410
Is she breathing?

13:25.410 --> 13:26.320
Yes!

13:27.020 --> 13:28.600
<i>Has she run out of magical energy?</i>

13:28.600 --> 13:30.610
M-Master!

13:30.610 --> 13:34.250
It isn't easy for those of Demon King's 
class to come to the surface.

13:34.250 --> 13:37.000
That is why you used me, isn't it?

13:37.000 --> 13:39.760
The dog has eaten some 
incredible magical energy.

13:39.760 --> 13:43.220
We want it. We want to take it back with us.

13:43.220 --> 13:44.680
It can't be!

13:44.680 --> 13:47.510
That is why you've used me as a vessel?

14:00.580 --> 14:03.910
<i>Of all the foes I've encountered so far, 
this one is of the highest level.</i>

14:04.360 --> 14:07.160
<i>The demon pillar from 
before was extraordinary,</i>

14:07.160 --> 14:09.320
<i>but I had allies then.</i>

14:11.760 --> 14:13.200
Saitou...

14:13.790 --> 14:15.710
Take Lafanpan and run back to town.

14:15.710 --> 14:17.120
What?

14:17.120 --> 14:18.510
You'll hold me back!

14:18.510 --> 14:20.630
You won't be of any use, so just go!

14:21.080 --> 14:22.340
All right.

14:23.050 --> 14:27.000
Leave the geezer and the dog. 
I'll bring them back with me.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.180
No, but...

14:28.180 --> 14:29.330
Just go!

14:29.330 --> 14:31.080
You'll just be in the way!

14:33.740 --> 14:35.180
I'll leave it to you!

14:37.520 --> 14:38.900
You're not getting away!

14:40.620 --> 14:41.730
Run!

14:48.330 --> 14:50.360
<i>I'm sorry, Father.</i>

14:50.360 --> 14:52.950
<i>I won't be able to save you this time.</i>

14:53.290 --> 14:56.860
<i>But I will save Saitou and Lafanpan.</i>

14:56.860 --> 14:58.710
<i>I'll put my life on the line for it.</i>

15:00.630 --> 15:01.840
<i>Saitou...</i>

15:01.840 --> 15:05.290
<i>I've never once thought 
that you slowed me down.</i>

15:05.290 --> 15:07.840
<i>I'm no good without you.</i>

15:08.870 --> 15:10.880
<i>That's why you must survive!</i>

15:11.610 --> 15:14.400
How lovely. I'm starting to want 
a taxidermy made of you.

15:14.400 --> 15:17.390
You really love your taxidermy, don't you?

15:17.390 --> 15:21.260
I love things both beautiful and strange.

15:31.170 --> 15:32.160
You come too!

15:32.160 --> 15:33.400
It's dangerous here!

15:33.720 --> 15:35.030
Ow!

15:41.460 --> 15:45.200
<i>It's not like I want to leave 
my friends behind either!</i>

15:45.650 --> 15:47.460
<i>Lock-picking and repair...</i>

15:47.460 --> 15:49.200
<i>What good is being a handyman?</i>

15:49.200 --> 15:52.560
<i>When it really counts, 
I'm completely useless!</i>

15:55.680 --> 15:57.200
Morlock-san?

16:00.480 --> 16:02.180
<i>Those blows are powerful.</i>

16:04.620 --> 16:05.850
Oh no!

16:08.980 --> 16:10.560
Don't struggle, now.

16:10.560 --> 16:12.800
You'll make for a beautiful stuffed specimen.

16:12.800 --> 16:15.590
We'll have to make sure she 
isn't damaged as we drain her blood.

16:15.930 --> 16:18.280
That's it. Good girl.

16:28.280 --> 16:29.370
Saitou!

16:29.370 --> 16:30.630
Don't!

16:34.140 --> 16:36.010
M-My eyes!

16:36.010 --> 16:37.040
Holy water?

16:37.040 --> 16:38.600
You won't be able to cut through!

16:38.600 --> 16:40.350
Enough! Just run!

16:40.350 --> 16:42.750
Please cut this!

16:43.310 --> 16:45.310
<i>The scissors from Saitou's world!</i>

16:45.310 --> 16:46.900
He's trying to cut the threads?

16:46.900 --> 16:49.630
With a human's blade, 
that simply isn't possi—

16:52.330 --> 16:53.490
<i>He cut them!</i>

16:53.490 --> 16:55.700
That's dwarven craftsmanship for you!

17:07.490 --> 17:11.120
That hurts!

17:14.630 --> 17:16.640
At the foot of the frozen peaks...

17:16.640 --> 17:18.960
stand eternal icicle flowers...

17:19.310 --> 17:20.460
An incantation?!

17:20.460 --> 17:22.620
In that garden where time has stopped,

17:22.620 --> 17:24.920
a form like that of a grave marker...

17:24.920 --> 17:26.130
Ice...

17:26.130 --> 17:26.840
...bound...

17:26.840 --> 17:28.310
...Gaol!

17:31.850 --> 17:34.380
I'm liking her more and more.

17:34.380 --> 17:36.360
Let's take her back with us like this.

17:37.350 --> 17:38.890
My legs are...

17:40.490 --> 17:43.630
<i>Sacred Ice Casket. Tier six magic.</i>

17:43.630 --> 17:45.380
<i>I saw it in Morlock-san's magical tomes!</i>

17:45.380 --> 17:47.960
<i>It will encase one human in ice!</i>

17:47.960 --> 17:49.410
Stay back!

17:49.410 --> 17:51.080
Now is your chance...

17:51.980 --> 17:53.320
<i>Raelza...</i>

17:53.320 --> 17:54.970
<i>For me, you are...</i>

17:54.970 --> 17:56.100
<i>You are...</i>

17:58.440 --> 18:00.010
S-Saitou!

18:03.840 --> 18:05.930
Oh! We can move.

18:06.710 --> 18:09.090
We don't need you.

18:09.090 --> 18:11.270
This is what you get for interfering.

18:11.760 --> 18:13.090
Stop!

18:33.960 --> 18:39.680
<i>My children are fighting, 
but this decrepit old body won't move.</i>

18:40.130 --> 18:42.250
<i>I feel so frustrated.</i>

18:45.210 --> 18:46.680
<i>This magical energy...</i>

18:47.250 --> 18:51.510
<i>Saitou must have carried me over to the dog.</i>

18:52.630 --> 18:55.120
<i>I feel it. I can feel it!</i>

18:55.120 --> 18:57.100
<i>The magical energy 
that was stolen from me...</i>

18:57.100 --> 19:00.530
<i>Dog, please give it back!</i>

19:00.530 --> 19:03.960
<i>My daughter... My children's 
lives are in danger!</i>

19:14.650 --> 19:16.330
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

19:16.720 --> 19:20.800
<i>You're telling me to look 
after the pup in exchange.</i>

19:21.970 --> 19:23.460
<i>I understand.</i>

19:24.010 --> 19:28.090
<i>After all, I love my own children very much.</i>

19:33.840 --> 19:36.480
She's all beat up now.

19:36.480 --> 19:38.870
I don't care anymore.

19:38.870 --> 19:41.660
She's all dirty, so I don't 
want to take her back anymore.

19:42.990 --> 19:44.460
<i>Raelza...</i>

19:44.460 --> 19:46.620
<i>My dear daughter!</i>

19:46.620 --> 19:49.120
<i>Brave and noble warrior!</i>

19:49.120 --> 19:51.000
You two can disappear together!

19:58.840 --> 19:59.890
Oh.

19:59.890 --> 20:00.720
Huh?

20:02.400 --> 20:04.100
Who did that?

20:09.640 --> 20:11.100
Saitou!

20:12.230 --> 20:13.760
Saitou!

20:13.760 --> 20:15.310
Raelza...

20:19.020 --> 20:22.560
Tier six magic... Wind Killing Sword.

20:22.560 --> 20:23.150
Which means...

20:23.760 --> 20:27.580
Impressive, Saitou. You've studied well!

20:31.040 --> 20:34.200
That is why you will be 
my daughter's husband!

20:34.760 --> 20:37.000
Now, leave the rest to your dad.

20:37.000 --> 20:39.760
Blast it! This magical energy!

20:40.050 --> 20:43.250
You took our dog, didn't you?!

20:43.250 --> 20:45.000
What are you talking about?

20:45.000 --> 20:46.940
It was my magical energy to begin with.

20:46.940 --> 20:48.980
Grandpa, are you all right?

20:52.200 --> 20:54.140
Eight Formations of the Fires of War!

20:54.810 --> 20:56.320
Flame Sword!

20:57.700 --> 21:00.320
Seventh Sword! Sixth Sword!

21:00.320 --> 21:02.520
We have magic too!

21:02.520 --> 21:04.940
Two mouths can speak incantations faster!

21:06.940 --> 21:09.970
Fifth Sword! Fourth Sword!

21:11.210 --> 21:14.280
Three are my fangs! Two are my arms!

21:15.200 --> 21:17.560
At the foot of the frozen peaks...

21:15.200 --> 21:17.560
stand eternal icicle flowers.

21:17.560 --> 21:20.110
In that garden where time has stopped,

21:17.560 --> 21:20.110
a form like that of a grave marker...

21:20.110 --> 21:21.030
Ice...

21:20.110 --> 21:21.030
...bound...

21:21.030 --> 21:21.920
...Gaol!

21:25.330 --> 21:28.100
Pierce through, Red Flames!

21:45.990 --> 21:49.070
An eight-pointed Flame Sword?

21:49.080 --> 21:51.450
How... How could a human have...

21:52.030 --> 21:53.650
You have been punished.

21:58.830 --> 22:00.130
Geezer...

22:00.130 --> 22:01.720
Morlock-san.

22:10.090 --> 22:15.470
Raelza, your... our old man is amazing!

22:17.360 --> 22:18.770
Father!

22:18.770 --> 22:20.450
Raelza...

22:21.600 --> 22:23.940
You're willing to call me "Father"?

22:23.940 --> 22:27.200
Are you playing around right now? 
Don't go growing ears like that!

22:25.940 --> 22:29.950
<b>To Be Continued!</b>

22:49.970 --> 22:52.760
<i>Like being gently carried away on a current</i>

22:52.760 --> 22:55.430
<i>Like drifting off to sleep at night</i>

22:55.430 --> 22:57.680
<i>Like there's nothing 
particularly special about it</i>

22:57.680 --> 22:59.640
<i>Our hearts are one</i>

22:59.640 --> 23:02.480
<i>"See you later" illuminates the way</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:04.520
<i>To the depths of the future</i>

23:04.520 --> 23:09.400
<i>Where kindness is the one 
thing I'm certain I felt</i>

23:09.400 --> 23:14.370
<i>You know, I'm sure we 
don't know anything</i>

23:14.370 --> 23:19.330
<i>But you know, for right now, that's fine</i>

23:19.330 --> 23:22.000
<i>I'm waiting, I'm waiting</i>

23:22.000 --> 23:24.170
<i>Let's sing here again</i>

23:24.170 --> 23:26.960
<i>One day, we'll shine the light</i>

23:26.960 --> 23:29.630
<i>Now, I think I can embrace even my tears</i>

23:29.630 --> 23:31.720
<i>As we picture it, as we paint it</i>

23:31.720 --> 23:33.890
<i>A single bit of warmth is all there is</i>

23:33.890 --> 23:40.440
<i>And now, so that we can laugh,
let's hold hands</i>

23:40.440 --> 23:46.270
<i>That’s right, it will 
blossom in the skies</i>

23:46.270 --> 23:52.450
<i>A guidepost showing us the way to live</i>
